          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yanaaba amaiso, yaturuka, yagaruka nambere bali naayegumya. Yaragira abaheereza ati: “Musembeze ebyokulya.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwe, baamusembereza wenka, na bali, baabasembereza bonka, habwokuba, Abamisiri, tibaalyaga n'Abahebburaayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaana ba Yakobbo, baikara omumaiso ga Yosefu, nkooku baahonderanganaga omu myaka ey'obukuru, okubandiza ha muzigaijo okuhika hali macura, baatandika okurorangana, nibahunirra muno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosefu yababegera ebibego, yabibatwekera, baitu ekibego ekya Benyamiini, kikakira eby'abandi boona emirundi etaano. Baanywa, baasemererwa hamu na uwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.34",
